  db 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 F3 0F 11 8B 2C 01 00 00 41 0F 28 CA F3 0F 11 83 30 01 00 00 41 0F 28 C2 F3 0F 11 93 28 01 00 00 90 90 90 90 90
  
