  db 90 90 90 90 90 90 45 0F 28 53 B0 F3 0F 11 A3 38 01 00 00 F3 0F 11 AB 3C 01 00 00 F3 0F 11 9B C8 01 00 00 F3 41 0F 59 C5 45 0F 28 6B 80 F3 0F 59 CE 41 0F 28 73 F0 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 90 90

